<http://data.silknow.org/event/f648a4f6-5edb-3962-b8c1-90f971a44ddc>
        a                              ecrm:E8_Acquisition ;
        rdfs:comment                   "The poke of the bonnet is very like the crown of a contemporary man's top hat. We also have a man's cream plush top hat from the same period which has oxidised to almost exactly the same colour as this bonnet, and is in a very similar fabric, but made in slightly larger dimensions. The main structural difference between the two hats is in the shape of their brims. See T.765B-1913"@en ;
        ecrm:P22_transferred_title_to  <http://data.silknow.org/actor/f0577f91-f887-3019-bf88-f9e5ba019390> ;
        ecrm:P24_transferred_title_of  <http://data.silknow.org/object/7abf2a3c-bd91-312b-82e1-16f2c11e7e55> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "The poke of the bonnet is very like the crown of a contemporary man's top hat. We also have a man's cream plush top hat from the same period which has oxidised to almost exactly the same colour as this bonnet, and is in a very similar fabric, but made in slightly larger dimensions. The main structural difference between the two hats is in the shape of their brims. See T.765B-1913"@en .

