        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Woman's poke bonnet with high cylindrical poke and wide brim, cream beaver plush trimmed with brown velvet ribbons and cream ostrich feathers. The brim faced with cream silk satin which has oxidised to a soft brownish colour"@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/7abf2a3c-bd91-312b-82e1-16f2c11e7e55> .

